# Host-local files that live only on a deploy box.
# The deploy-agent refuses to build a dirty worktree, and untracked files count
# as dirty — leaving these unignored blocks every automated deploy. On mld-pos
# these are docker-compose.lan.yml (the LAN override that publishes the
# 192.168.1.212 bindings nginx proxies to, pinned via COMPOSE_FILE in .env) and
# the timestamped copies taken before maintenance.
docker-compose.lan.yml
*.bak
*.bak-*
